# CODEOWNERS additions for the DEFAULT BRANCH (main) of the Patchwork
# repository. Merge these lines into main's .github/CODEOWNERS (create it if
# it does not exist).
#
# The Submission paths guard decides which catalogue pull requests may
# pass, so any change to it needs review by a small, named security team,
# not just any collaborator with write access. Every rule must name real
# accounts or teams; replace the placeholder before installing:
#
#      /.github/workflows/submission-paths.yml    @<owner>/<security-team>
#      /.github/CODEOWNERS                        @<owner>/<security-team>
#
# The main branch ruleset must require review from Code Owners for this to
# take effect (see the catalogue branch's MAINTAINERS.md).
